  "mode": "baked",
  "note": "The face is drawn in the glass: the eyes are shallow glossy lenses (lo_eyes) laid flush on the convex glass, with the dark violet iris, the pupil and two catchlights; the lavender lids, the flick lashes, the brows, the small nose, the calm closed smile and the blush are baked into the body atlas. One expression is painted (no face sheet, no morphs): the clips' `faces` are hints only, and the mouth never opens. Blinking scales the blink bones (play `blink` over any clip): each lens squashes onto its painted lash line and sinks under the glass. socket_core sits on the glass's middle (the pulse strike's reflected beam). Obsidian's face glows pale in the black glass (its own glow mask).",
